ps://docs.browserbase.com">Docs</a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--login-mobile"><a class="nav__item__button btn btn--nav-primary" href="/sign-in">Log in</a></li></ul></nav><div class="nav__list--secondary cluster"><div class="nav__item--login-desktop"><a class="btn btn--nav-secondary" href="/sign-in">Log in</a></div><div class="nav__item--cta"><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/sign-up"><span class="btn__text">Sign up</span></a></div><div class="nav__item--cta"><a class="btn btn--chevron" href="/contact"><span class="btn__text">Get a demo</span><span class="btn__icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M503.91-480l-189-189L384-738.09 642.09-480 384-221.91 314.91-291l189-189Z"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></header><main id="main" class="type-body wrapper"><section id="2b71b41de823" class="section full wrapper theme-cool-gray"><div class="u-grid-line--x"><div class="section"><div class="grid"><div class="textLockUp textLockUp--left pricingCards__textLockUp" data-style-variant="heading-2"><div class="textLockUp__content"><h1 class="textLockUp__title u-wordbreak type-heading-2"><span>Browser agent infrastructure that scales with you</span></h1><div class="textLockUp__body stack text type-body-3"><p>Every plan scales past its included usage, so no caps or throttling as you build, billed at your plan’s rate. And as always, you can get started for free.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="pricingCards__cards | region--margin"><article class="pricingCard"><header class="pricingCard__header"><h2 class="pricingCard__title type-heading-4">Free Plan</h2><p class="pricingCard__price type-heading-4">$0/mo</p></header><div class="pricingCard-header__cta"><a class="btn btn--chevron" href="/sign-up"><span class="btn__text">Start for free</span><span class="btn__icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M503.91-480l-189-189L384-738.09 642.09-480 384-221.91 314.91-291l189-189Z"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="pricingCard__description | type-body-3"><p>Get started with Browserbase. Explore and prototype ideas.</p></div><div class="pricingCard__sections"><div class="pricingCard-section"><p class="pricingCard-section__title | type-eyebrow-1">Infrastructure</p><ul class="pricingCard-section__items"><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-gray">3</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">concurrent browsers</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-pink">1</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">browser hour</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-blue">3</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">Agent runs included</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-yellow">1,000</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">Search calls</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-green">1,000</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">Fetch calls</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip">15</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">minutes /session</span></li></ul></div><div class="pricingCard-section"><p class="pricingCard-section__title | type-eyebrow-1">Capabilities</p><ul class="pricingCard-section__items"><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-red">Models</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">$5 in tokens</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-yellow">Runtime</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">included</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="pricingCard__cta"><a class="btn btn--chevron" href="/sign-up"><span class="btn__text">Start for free</span><span class="btn__icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M503.91-480l-189-189L384-738.09 642.09-480 384-221.91 314.91-291l189-189Z"></path></svg></span></a></div></article><article class="pricingCard"><header class="pricingCard__header"><h2 class="pricingCard__title type-heading-4">Developer Plan</h2><p class="pricingCard__price type-heading-4">$20/mo</p></header><div class="pricingCard-header__cta"><a class="btn btn--chevron" href="/sign-up"><span class="btn__text">Get Developer</span><span class="btn__icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M503.91-480l-189-189L384-738.09 642.09-480 384-221.91 314.91-291l189-189Z"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="pricingCard__description | type-body-3"><p>Build and test real workflows. Prepare for production.</p></div><div class="pricingCard__sections"><div class="pricingCard-section"><p class="pricingCard-section__title | type-eyebrow-1">Infrastructure</p><ul class="pricingCard-section__items"><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-gray">25</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">concurrent browsers</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><details class="pricingCard-item__details"><summary class="pricingCard-item__summary"><span class="pricingCard-item__label type-chip u-accent-bg--pale-pink">100</span><span class="pricingCard-item__description">browser hours</span><span class="pricingCard-ite