rd-item__description">HIPAA (BAA) &amp; DPA</span></li><li class="pricingCard-item"><span class="pricingCard-item__description">SSO available</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="pricingCard__cta"><a class="btn btn--chevron" href="/contact"><span class="btn__text">Contact sales</span><span class="btn__icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M503.91-480l-189-189L384-738.09 642.09-480 384-221.91 314.91-291l189-189Z"></path></svg></span></a></div></article></div></div></div></section><section class="section quote u-accent-bg--extra-pale-magenta"><fk-scroll-reveal><figure class="grid"><div class="quote__content"><blockquote class="quote__text | type-heading-2"><span class="u-accent">Not worrying about all that infra work and focusing directly on the impact I can bring to our sales teams was a huge unblock</span></blockquote><figcaption class="quote__caption | u-mt--space-1"><span class="quote__citation">Boogie Cigdemoglu</span><span class="quote__citationDescriptor">, <!-- -->Lead Engineer, Amplitude</span></figcaption></div></figure></fk-scroll-reveal></section><section id="compare-plans" class="pricingTable" data-sticky-column-header="true" data-sticky-row-header="true"><fk-scroll-reveal><div class="region--margin pricingTable__container grid theme-light"><div class="pricingTable__table" style="--data-columns:4"><table><caption class="table-title | type-heading-3">Compare plans</caption><thead class="table-header"><tr class="table-header__columns"><th class="is-visually-hidden" scope="col">Feature</th><th class="pricingTable-cell pricingTable-cell--button" scope="col"><a class="btn btn--animated" href="/sign-up"><span class="btn__text">Start for Free</span><span class="btn__icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.66875 6.41